    "created_at": "2016-11-06T02:21:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-06T02:21:24Z",
    "body": "A bigger problem here is that the term **machine-readable equivalent of the element's contents**  currently is not referenced anywhere in the spec, so perhaps we should fix that first by specifying when this machine-readable equivalent is being used.\n",
